        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stephen King, Ben E. King\n- Works: The Body, Different Seasons, Stand by Me\n- Places: Oregon\n- Topics: film adaptation, plot, title origin\n\nFacts:\n- Stephen King originally published the novella \"The Body\" in his 1982 collection \"Different Seasons.\"\n- The 1986 film \"Stand by Me\" was adapted from Stephen King's 1982 novella \"The Body.\"\n- The title of \"Stand by Me\" was derived from Ben E. King's song \"Stand by Me,\" which plays over the film's ending credits.\n- \"Stand by Me\" tells the story of four boys in a small town in Oregon who go on a hike to find the dead body of a missing child.",
